    },
    {
      "paper": "D6",
      "claim": "above T_c the optimal support gains the A-pair",
      "evidence": "LEAN THEOREM for the uncapped profile and the A-pair algebra; NUMERICAL EVIDENCE (cutting-plane LP, certified per cell by a rational primal/dual pair) for the support change; the LP optimum is NOT recorded as a universal optimum"
